{"version":1,"key":"card:186","content":{"id":186,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在数学上，逆时针旋转 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\theta","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\theta"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 角度的变换矩阵为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\begin{bmatrix}\n\\cos\\theta &-\\sin\\theta \\\\\n\\sin\\theta &\\cos\\theta\n\\end{bmatrix}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要进行顺时针旋转，只需要将上面的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\theta","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\theta"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 换为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"-\\theta","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-\\theta"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 即可得到顺时针旋转的变换矩阵"}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\begin{bmatrix}\n\\cos\\theta &\\sin\\theta \\\\\n-\\sin\\theta &\\cos\\theta\n\\end{bmatrix}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const { PI, sin, cos } = Math\nconst theta = PI / 4\n\nctx.transform(cos(theta), -sin(theta), sin(theta), cos(theta), 0, 0)\nctx.fillRect(200, 200, 100, 100)","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f8bad714-67ba-4f08-aff4-ea6f40fc24bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rotate(theta)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法对图形进行顺时针旋转 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"theta","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 角度"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"ctx.rotate(PI / 4)","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b4258bca-2f11-4eba-9fa3-2544647c06f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Canvas/变换"],"createTime":1690383970241,"updateTime":1743303640408,"linkedCards":[{"id":183,"target":{"key":"card:183","type":"card","id":183},"summary":"在很多时候我们需要对绘制的对象进行拉伸，旋转，平移等操作，这些操作可以看做是对坐标进行了变换，在数学上的处理是对当前坐标乘以一个矩阵得到一个新的坐标，然后将新坐标表示的点绘制在画布上 其中等式左边是变换矩阵与当前坐标，右边为变换后的坐标。 ...","tags":["Canvas/变换"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640408}}